                                "example_id": "cdece655-75fc-47ab-acae-2dff42dc3b2e",
                                "sense_id": "698546ff-26af-3324-9814-1f48bb250167",
                                "text": "At first Matenge had hated his brother because he felt the chieftaincy should be his, and this hatred drove him to overreach himself until he was discovered in a plot to assassinate his brother."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8507faec-a774-41d4-8d7a-e9ca98ffd5a0",
                                "sense_id": "698546ff-26af-3324-9814-1f48bb250167",
                                "text": "The two principles that governed my life at Mqhekezweni were chieftaincy and the Church."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "66f1bce5-2145-3c57-92d2-0109facdc29e",
                        "entry_id": "1bd0ad8c-0b57-3f9e-a11b-dc4bcc2e48bf",
                        "glosses": [
